  id: halcyrie
  dexNumber: 97
  displayName: Halcyrie
  lore: The dawn bird. It crosses the island once each morning with a halo over its
    crest and three ribbons of light behind it, and the day does not start until
    it has.
  personality: Radiant, unhurried, answers kindness and nothing else.
